01:04:32,000 --> 01:04:38,000
Where to Invade Next is a 2015 American documentary film
written and directed by Michael Moore.

9
01:12:36,000 --> 01:12:42,000
The film, in the style of a travelogue, has Moore spending time in countries such as Italy, France, Finland, Tunisia, Slovenia, Germany, and Portugal
where he experiences those countries' alternative methods of dealing with social and economic ills experienced in the United States.

10
01:20:40,000 --> 01:20:46,000
Moore's first film in six years, Where to Invade Next opened on December 23, 2015, in the United States and Canada, in
a limited run for one week only in a Los Angeles and New York City theater to qualify for the Oscars.

11
01:28:44,000 --> 01:28:50,000
It re-opened on February 12, 2016, across 308 screens.

12
01:36:48,000 --> 01:36:54,000
The film received generally positive reviews from critics.

13
01:44:52,000 --> 01:44:58,000
The film explores themes of france, politics, germany, italy, africa.

14
01:52:56,000 --> 01:53:02,000
The tone is lighthearted.
